WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.201 line:92%
-It is so nice to be here.

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:03.803 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm Jess.
I'm a Canadian.

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:04.304 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Cheers ]

00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:07.874
Yes, you know,
we walk amongst you undetected.

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:09.809 size:88% position:44% line:92%
That's what we're doing.

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:12.345 align:start size:94% position:6%
I live here now.
I moved to America.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:14.514 align:start size:94% position:6%
Uh-huh. Yeah.
Just -- Just before

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:17.751 align:start size:94% position:6%
the last election.
That was when I did it.

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:18.785 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, um...
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:22.322 size:81% position:41%
Yeah, and I moved here
with my Muslim wife.

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:22.856 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Chuckles ]

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:27.694
Right, just making all the best
choices all of the time.

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:28.862 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:34.034 align:start size:94% position:6%
America's been fun.
You know, we've been marchin'.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:34.768 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:37.470
And I've been very proud
of my signs at the march,

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.671 line:92%
which I know is not, like,

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:41.307 align:start size:94% position:6%
the point of the march
or anything.

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:44.110 size:81% position:41%
I went to a gay march
with my wife recently,

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:47.047 align:start size:94% position:6%
and my sign said,
"Jihad me at hello."

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:50.650 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
So I thought that was cute.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:55.989 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:58.925 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm Jewish.
My wife is Palestinian.

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:02.095 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you. That's how
our families reacted, as well.

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:03.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Yeah.

00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:06.633
It was a very tiny wedding,
as you can imagine, very small.

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:09.602 size:84% position:42%
It was just me, her,
and a U.N. peacekeeper.

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:14.274 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
That was the whole party.

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:16.609 size:88% position:44% line:92%
I moved in to her place.

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:19.212 line:92%
She didn't want me there.

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:21.448 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.448 --> 00:01:25.618 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I moved in anyway.
You know how we do.

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:30.723 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:31.958 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You know.

00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:33.593
My wife and I have been together
a little while,

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:37.263 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we decided to spice things
up with a little role play.

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:39.232 size:81% position:41% line:92%
It wasn't a good idea.

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:39.766 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:42.969 align:start size:94% position:6%
My wife doesn't have a lot of,
like, acting range.

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:45.505 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, she only knows
how to be the bitchy version

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:47.474 line:92%
of whatever the character is.

00:01:47.474 --> 00:01:49.109 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:49.776 line:92%
You guys see the problem.

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:51.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
We did something basic.
No big deal.

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:52.912 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Masseuse, client, okay?

00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:55.181 align:start size:94% position:6%
She was the client.
I was a masseuse.

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:57.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
She laid down on the bed,
I left the room.

00:01:57.784 --> 00:01:59.119 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I got into character.

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:01.287 line:92%
I was Helga from Scandinavia.

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:03.189 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Obviously.

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:05.625 size:84% position:42%
Deep-tissue specialist,
made a mean meatball.

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:08.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like,
I knew my character, right?

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:10.797 size:84% position:42%
So, I go into the room,
and I announce myself,

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:13.433 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I'm like, "Helga's here,
hello," or whatever.

00:02:13.433 --> 00:02:13.967 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:15.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
And my wife turned around,
and she was like,

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:18.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Oh, I'm sorry.
I ordered a man."

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:22.342 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:24.677 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's not cool.

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:27.714 line:92%
I'm not the coolest person.

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:29.616 line:92%
Don't all argue with me at once.

00:02:29.616 --> 00:02:30.183 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:33.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
When I was a kid,
I once shoplifted a thesaurus.

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:34.254 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.254 --> 00:02:38.091
But then I felt so guilty,
so remorseful, so repentant,

00:02:38.091 --> 00:02:42.829
so sorry, so penitent,
so contrite, I brought it back.

00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:49.869
You know, it's like...
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:51.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
You guys might be surprised
to learn this,

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:56.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I haven't always been
a hilarious comedian.

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:58.444 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I used to be a lawyer.

00:02:58.444 --> 00:03:01.347 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's a decision
I made with my life.

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:01.981 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:05.218
And I used to be a war-crimes
lawyer with the United Nations.

00:03:05.218 --> 00:03:09.255 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, until I decided
it was time to get serious.

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:09.989 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.989 --> 00:03:12.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
And here we are.
You know?

00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:13.560 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Life is short, right?

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:15.962
Sometimes you just got to look
yourself in the mirror and say,

00:03:15.962 --> 00:03:19.432
"Jess, where's this whole being
a U.N. war crimes lawyer thing

00:03:19.432 --> 00:03:22.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
really gonna get you?"
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.268 --> 00:03:24.971 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sure, bringing war criminals
to justice is a great way

00:03:24.971 --> 00:03:27.840
to kill time
and hang out with your friends.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:30.977 align:start size:94% position:6%
But is there a future in it?
You know?

00:03:30.977 --> 00:03:31.945 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:31.945 --> 00:03:34.013 size:84% position:42%
Maybe it's time you put
your law degree to use

00:03:34.013 --> 00:03:37.717
bailing degenerate comics
out of minor drug offenses.

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:42.889 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:42.889 --> 00:03:45.058 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was every conversation
when I started comedy.

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:47.627
It was like, "Jess, I'm having
a little bit of a legal issue."

00:03:47.627 --> 00:03:51.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Uh-huh, uh-huh, okay.
Did you commit a genocide?

00:03:51.364 --> 00:03:53.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because if not,
I cannot help you."

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:56.069 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.069 --> 00:03:59.138
I did get asked over the years
if I had any doubts or regrets

00:03:59.138 --> 00:04:01.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
going from law to comedy,
and I definitely did

00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:02.942 align:start size:94% position:6%
for a little while,
until I found out

00:04:02.942 --> 00:04:07.080
that a woman I used to work with
married George fricking Clooney.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:10.817 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like, "Whew!
Really dodged a bullet there."

00:04:10.817 --> 00:04:12.552 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know what I mean?
[ Laughter ]

00:04:12.552 --> 00:04:15.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
Got out right in time!
That was close.

00:04:15.188 --> 00:04:18.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
George Clooney?
Gross, gross, gross.

00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:19.592 align:start size:94% position:6%
Every night?
No, thank you.

00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:22.161 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Not for me, no.

00:04:22.161 --> 00:04:26.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
And all that fame, too?
Just like that, in an instant?

00:04:26.532 --> 00:04:27.834 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Chuckles ]

00:04:27.834 --> 00:04:31.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, I prefer to earn it
normally, 18 people at a time,

00:04:31.204 --> 00:04:34.040 size:88% position:44%
in the basement of a bar
as a stand-up comedian.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.042 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know?
That's --

00:04:36.042 --> 00:04:39.979 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:39.979 --> 00:04:42.015 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't always like
to bring up my former career.

00:04:42.015 --> 00:04:43.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
I did have a woman
heckle me once.

00:04:43.683 --> 00:04:47.320 align:start size:94% position:6%
She yelled,
"You should've stuck to law."

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:47.854 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah, I know.

00:04:47.854 --> 00:04:51.357
I was like "You don't know
how bad at law I was, lady."

00:04:51.357 --> 00:04:52.458 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:52.458 --> 00:04:53.126 size:75% position:38% line:92%
I really showed her.

00:04:53.126 --> 00:04:55.395 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you guys, so much.
I'm Jess Salomon.

00:04:55.395 --> 00:04:56.996 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:56.996 --> 00:05:00.900 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:03.670 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, my God!

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:04.637 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Jess Salomon!

00:05:04.637 --> 00:05:08.241 line:92%
I like your shoes, by the way.

00:05:08.241 --> 00:05:09.375 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Jess Salomon, everybody!

00:05:09.375 --> 00:05:14.547 align:start size:94% position:6%
Her comedy album
is available now on iTunes!

